          blockGroup: 90495062423f402eaf2c6da5b01de3ec
          sortingKey: "000196"
          type: code
          content: >-
            g_training, g_testing = nx.Graph(), nx.Graph()

            for u, v, info in B_proj.edges(data=True):
                if info['time'] < data_soglia:
                    g_training.add_edge(u, v)
                elif info['time'] < data_soglia_finale:
                    g_testing.add_edge(u, v)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: b2974ccfb9ff4acc98e73a8dda1a20b0
          blockGroup: ea936076e1ba4b7cbcc2cb05fc630142
          sortingKey: "000197"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Dimensione dei grafi del:"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 997b25fc306a4843a9fd80cda000b287
          blockGroup: bae1c35cfa5242739e7200b0aa0df4ed
          sortingKey: "000198"
          type: text-cell-bullet
          content: "G_1 test: 5539"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 60e5ebb4f0b24566976032c5da8e00ed
          blockGroup: 40f302bb91eb4e31979d78eaa6a03fdb
          sortingKey: "000199"
          type: text-cell-bullet
          content: "G_0 train: 21743"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 0de4e02157254ee691a76d9c4fca9dcd
          blockGroup: e78403538ee6459f8149e7eba229c0fa
          sortingKey: "000200"
          type: code
          content: g_testing.size(), g_training.size()
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 1d48295873644b6b85d4fc38c1b65cb1
          blockGroup: bcc725f106de4c43b584e9abac56ddbc
          sortingKey: "000201"
          type: text-cell-h3
          content: Costruzione datapoint
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: a5b76e06c0ba4d99bf07345c84738f51
          blockGroup: 5368c947aa7446289da956ea39489424
          sortingKey: "000202"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: Identifico quali sono i datapoint da cui estrarre delle feature o caratteristiche.
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 716bc052e9844ea387db050802b3ca92
          blockGroup: 6cfb924c7462407186394b14a09dd2aa
          sortingKey: "000203"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: Nel mio caso le istanze oggetto della classificazione sono le coppie di nodi u, v appartenenti al grafo G_0
            (training)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 53200dbe1a4d4aa8a79afefd421052e2
          blockGroup: e73f6d315a0446afbd94eef7dfada7e0
          sortingKey: "000204"
          type: text-cell-bullet
          content: considero solo le coppie di G_0 che sono comprese in G_1
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 9e140c02881646df9a72a8cc5b9ad100
          blockGroup: cd7f71ac7eab4e1591995b91ff6a95d2
          sortingKey: "000205"
          type: text-cell-bullet
          content: a queste coppie associo l'etichetta 0 -> se in G_1 (testing) non si è formata una relazione tra loro
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 5b7cac317f6d4c45aab6f3fc57927a47
          blockGroup: 18eac3133728426c8eb244d89f3a049d
          sortingKey: "000206"
          type: text-cell-bullet
          content: altrimenti associo l'etichetta 1 -> se in G_1 si è formata la relazione
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 39f159f046d94b83bf399e88cdf2974b
          blockGroup: 9c115bf610a340e2847f010d97dba0b9
          sortingKey: "000207"
          type: code
          content: >-
            list_edges = np.array([{u,v} for u,v in g_testing.edges()])

            len(list_edges)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: ce47ab332d0d41619318dc2332f965d0
          blockGroup: d1b5450b094842e08650ff3edb1e2011
          sortingKey: "000208"
          type: text-cell-h3
          content: Datapoints positivi - label 1
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 16c927110ad14406b4408e856cb3ec83
          blockGroup: cae99018865d4de4b7f2c2b32ef4d432
          sortingKey: "000209"
          type: code
          content: positive_datapoints = np.random.choice(list_edges, replace = False, size = 570)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: f24ccb8157fe44d48c2a46b0e6f91faf
          blockGroup: 3793209e04e44a6a9489d22c04c96672
          sortingKey: "000210"
          type: code
          content: positive_datapoints = [(u,v) for u,v in positive_datapoints if g_training.has_node(u) and
            g_training.has_node(v)]
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 37f945fffac04352b78f20056d9356fb
          blockGroup: 7c612c93c47248788d2ee35f609099b1
          sortingKey: "000211"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Ottengo: 541 positive_datapoints"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges:
              - type: marks
                marks:
                  bold: true
                toCodePoint: 32
                fromCodePoint: 9
        - id: f7d292da46eb4caba1a430d1893b701d
          blockGroup: 8b3e0a8410994e918c957e519227c9af
          sortingKey: "000212"
          type: code
          content: len(positive_datapoints)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: ff2a8e1f3e56496baf11879407ace61b
          blockGroup: c5f29668ea584d92b91eb4bc92f987b8
          sortingKey: "000213"
          type: text-cell-h3
          content: Datapoints negativi - label 0
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 3eb60ea0a1fe4a2e8a004ad594cd09e3
          blockGroup: ad39dce1c91c4ec7bfc9606b0d4bf24d
          sortingKey: "000214"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Devo ottenere un numero di coppie uguale al numero di coppie dei positive_datapoints:"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 7bf3a7e2da7e486e98076fa93b31d410
          blockGroup: 628c477d32c1481089a4c3fb32d50a14
          sortingKey: "000215"
          type: code
          content: >-
            negative_datapoints = []

            nodes_set = list(g_testing.nodes())

            count = 0

            while count < len(positive_datapoints):
                u, v = np.random.choice(nodes_set, replace=False, size = 2)
                if (not g_testing.has_edge(u,v) and g_training.has_node(u) and g_training.has_node(v) and not g_training.has_edge(u,v)):
                    negative_datapoints.append((u,v))
                    count += 1
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: cbd548b6a7fd426da5fe11cfe9d888c4
          blockGroup: 6f8e5be72de24735a314956b1e246cc1
          sortingKey: "000216"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Ottengo: 541 negative_datapoints"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges:
              - type: marks
                marks:
                  bold: true
                toCodePoint: 32
                fromCodePoint: 9
        - id: b55582c0bea8489b83848a10aad25edf
          blockGroup: bf971d2abdff480bb733363e39718c00
          sortingKey: "000217"
          type: code
          content: len(negative_datapoints)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 37ea4d796f83475893dae1db3bde095d
          blockGroup: 11058cc488fb4573bf5e56417e803398
          sortingKey: "000218"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Trasformo ogni coppia di nodi in un vettore:"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 907f4c9ff4b44448a2821aaee3f1f63d
          blockGroup: e1fb6015bad44d0d8801159d7cdad650
          sortingKey: "000219"
          type: code
          content: dataset_link_prediction = pd.DataFrame()
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: fa177fc96c214563a9b0933538edb86d
          blockGroup: 01badf3e086f4d7dacc5c1e9e8a571f5
          sortingKey: "000220"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: insieme degli oggetti di cui calcolerò delle proprietà
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: f5e5639a574646a39a3430789658bb4e
          blockGroup: 2a8cd6ac6e8f4732bd15fe19c045edd5
          sortingKey: "000221"
          type: code
          content: datapoints = positive_datapoints + negative_datapoints
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: b1d5a5f6ec3042b39785006b860b1222
          blockGroup: 983301342efb4b7eb3dd0490e5d5a644
          sortingKey: "000222"
          type: code
          content: len(datapoints),datapoints[:10]
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: c0666e6dd58f4e9b96a26a1b6a95aca6
          blockGroup: da9b15f1827c4a8d9f29d68326ffa43e
          sortingKey: "000223"
          type: text-cell-h3
          content: Jaccard Coefficient
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 36ac00155f8247fc92a7aa6377428d5c
          blockGroup: dc0d326da7ab44ba99e97dae9bb5a85a
          sortingKey: "000224"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Prima proprietà che calcolo: per ogni coppia misura la similarità basata sui vicini comuni -> quanto il
            proprio vicinato si sovrappone."
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: e5a00a920fbb47deacf0706838473e1a
          blockGroup: cf6b65bed8a244988237a4940df0c188
          sortingKey: "000225"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: Data una coppia (u, v) ne calcolo il jaccard coefficient utilizzando il grafo G_0 (training)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 4203121d37b0437bbc5888a442360ce2
          blockGroup: 7f873627e33a4802a3b6a0086bf55fd1
          sortingKey: "000226"
          type: code
          content: dataset_link_prediction['jaccard'] = [p for _,_,p in nx.jaccard_coefficient(g_training, datapoints)]
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: a6fd60433bdc4f759deb3e66dd2706fb
          blockGroup: b8db3c0f4e3e4bc286a0ecf8ca41cd93
          sortingKey: "000227"
          type: code
          content: dataset_link_prediction
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 4d55a0fbc74e4c719035694cbd70f1bc
          blockGroup: 78acd5bc0c9147fca8e9f4595de5745f
          sortingKey: "000228"
          type: text-cell-h3
          content: Resource Allocation Index
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: e483cbc776a54944b80171991fc80e7d
          blockGroup: 842e45f69bc44b5ab7d9fab726a6783b
          sortingKey: "000229"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: Strutta l'idea del vicinato in comune. Un nodo hub è probabile che si spenda di meno a creare una connessione
            tra due nodi, meglio un nodo che è solo collegato tra i due nodi, senza avere altre connessioni.
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: a465c445ee7a4cba8e7321546bf47ff6
          blockGroup: 8eea90b4e1554d64a93f8bab9e2f16ad
          sortingKey: "000230"
          type: code
          content: dataset_link_prediction['rai'] = [p for _,_,p in nx.resource_allocation_index(g_training, datapoints)]
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: dd189614b64b4d80b2f21cc6c0c4d655
          blockGroup: 010eca8da9364f6e9db4703029ddb8e1
          sortingKey: "000231"
          type: text-cell-h3
          content: Adamic-Adar Index
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 910418d9338e4fd8b5c8a739c36288b6
          blockGroup: 1b6c1691ddcf4ced8c3a5ac402a8d089
          sortingKey: "000232"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: Data una coppia (u, v) ne calcolo l'Adamic-adar index (somma degli inversi dei logaritmi dei gradi dei vicini
            comuni)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: ade12bbef92b421eab10dbffe3048d64
          blockGroup: b32d11e4a37f4209aa382e3c8c819b08
          sortingKey: "000233"
          type: code
          content: dataset_link_prediction['aai'] = [p for _,_,p in nx.adamic_adar_index(g_training, datapoints)]
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: f028585deb0240b1ad33f584c66c0c88
          blockGroup: 89fc4b97d973439297304cec29f71abc
          sortingKey: "000234"
          type: text-cell-h3
          content: Preferential Attachment Index
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: b488ade39fc14aaebc7d95767ff3981e
          blockGroup: c83656b411f24056a5a9e1dd4f488d48
          sortingKey: "000235"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: Il preferential attachment è il risultato del prodotto del grado dei due estremi (attori).
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 5cb356857f7e48b8a23f1e439d812f43
          blockGroup: f079cda867e745a892639efd70c078e2
          sortingKey: "000236"
          type: code
          content: dataset_link_prediction['pref'] = [p for _,_,p in nx.preferential_attachment(g_training, datapoints)]
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 3f57a5859328463a878af0532f769cd0
          blockGroup: 2d0f9e10b1c0472ba82e695ed5286ef6
          sortingKey: "000237"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Infine inserisco la colonna delle etichette "
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: eed3bff5a7914db692f0fdfac03ef5ee
          blockGroup: 856b7a54893e43e3bf47524b93c619bb
          sortingKey: "000238"
          type: code
          content: dataset_link_prediction['label'] = [1 for _ in range(len(positive_datapoints))] + [0 for _ in
            range(len(negative_datapoints))]
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 119af654906648a6a28ea7b34fa8a295
          blockGroup: 9911e32451d34fa8a50b20b2f2929e3c
          sortingKey: "000239"
          type: code
          content: "dataset_link_prediction.head() #primi 5"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 4054aa09dc874dd4bff0baaca80f2261
          blockGroup: 0d518c64f718489192d4a5fb7c003698
          sortingKey: "000240"
          type: text-cell-h3
          content: Apprendimento supervisionato
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 515a5c8b5cf34078b3566e69aa042406
          blockGroup: e90e369c30b44071b4ba7ec42cc7763b
          sortingKey: "000241"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: 1) separare la matrice delle feature dal vettore delle etichette
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 9a55880b803e4da9a565697953c18c05
          blockGroup: ac4b218241d64edfbb20946b620a050c
          sortingKey: "000242"
          type: code
          content: >-
            X = dataset_link_prediction[['jaccard','rai','aai','pref']] #feature matrix

            y = dataset_link_prediction['label'] # label
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 260b085d058147baab10584b911838a7
          blockGroup: 7221f5f960de4213b2c3f85c021ac3bd
          sortingKey: "000243"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Dimensione X e y: ((1082, 4), (1082,))"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: f7510aa0fefa44c3b487f036267d2a02
          blockGroup: 1005d795e7984c62ae833b4e9fab2a62
          sortingKey: "000244"
          type: code
          content: X.shape, y.shape
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: ab2d9f9aa2904f1895c0a55d0a545133
          blockGroup: b08c0861239648b4abd173693c90a2bb
          sortingKey: "000245"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "2) divisione training e test: uso il metodo train_test_split di SKL."
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 32569d42feef4f3cb6c580f2f2d212c4
          blockGroup: b82a51c78aaf42da96913c326552fd8c
          sortingKey: "000246"
          type: code
          content: X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.3, shuffle=True, random_state=42)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 915d03655af847d7a03b50fe499822fc
          blockGroup: 175e2441d1174871a39f66d1f43ce5b9
          sortingKey: "000247"
          type: code
          content: "X_train.shape #(757, 4)"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: c14d846e06fb437c810cdd27644932c0
          blockGroup: d714744024c44915a0e99dc95b27aa8b
          sortingKey: "000248"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: 3) Ridimensionamento delle Feature (Feature Scaling)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: d5320c1c0954456d8420be0f551f3e05
          blockGroup: abaa9b3f964345a4bc85e50bbfabffd5
          sortingKey: "000249"
          type: code
          content: >-
            ct = ColumnTransformer([
                ('minmax',MinMaxScaler(),['jaccard','rai','aai','pref'])
            ])
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 5a1e82cb72884bdcb7e8845a92195468
          blockGroup: 278d1ed82e394bde9ae946e17f17ddc7
          sortingKey: "000250"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: 4) Classificazione mediante Logistic Regression
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: a74510717e3b41ccbb2790036a7f099f
          blockGroup: dcbcd9ccf5824b798edf84de6082e6be
          sortingKey: "000251"
          type: code
          content: >-
            link_predictor = Pipeline([
                ('preprocessing',ct),
                ('classifier',LogisticRegression(penalty='none'))
            ]

            )
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 235722018697455687125b527b681700
          blockGroup: d9e752c5da9a45708f2ba1785148ec82
          sortingKey: "000252"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: Procediamo con la fase di apprendimento, utilizzando la matrice delle feature standardizzate.
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 5b85a947f5fb4a439d3ad217c7cfa10d
          blockGroup: e8c622c666974560a8d46d9982c19101
          sortingKey: "000253"
          type: code
          content: link_predictor.fit(X_train, y_train)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: cf08671bd3ef4e73839349c131588579
          blockGroup: d6664342996e409da0d6694bb8541ea8
          sortingKey: "000254"
          type: code
          content: y_predicted = link_predictor.predict(X_test)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: b335a91942f944fd8d8e09ba504fcfd8
          blockGroup: bc1d51dc81894f3b9fae9c6c8d42a09b
          sortingKey: "000255"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: 5) Valutazione del modello
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 4fcf650061bc4909826c62c469afaff0
          blockGroup: 9733cdde37674745aba6cbdc883ba8ac
          sortingKey: "000256"
          type: code
          content: accuracy_score(y_test, y_predicted)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 12aab30360c548faad67bb1c7fbe34a5
          blockGroup: 2c7a54b6ff2a4b448efc5f4794c2a196
          sortingKey: "000257"
          type: code
          content: f1_score(y_test, y_predicted), recall_score(y_test, y_predicted), precision_score(y_test, y_predicted)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 6cd6447031304ef99381c36927648d35
          blockGroup: 5464af5afd00467eb6b23282fcf0c9f4
          sortingKey: "000258"
          type: code
          content: confusion_matrix(y_predicted, y_test)
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: a0ed99ce9a2a4b2f9b8b92f0ab488170
          blockGroup: 232a295a9b114746af45dc06a15e38ef
          sortingKey: "000259"
          type: code
          content: ConfusionMatrixDisplay.from_predictions(y_test, y_predicted, cmap = 'Blues')
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
        - id: 296e6ebbe58c44b9ba6886d072d1a920
          blockGroup: d1e338c6c35b49ada0651646804ac7fb
          sortingKey: "000260"
          type: text-cell-p
          content: "Ruolo delle feature:"
          metadata:
            deepnote_app_block_visible: true
            formattedRanges: []
        - id: 30a7d6e8cd1a48d6b5654ae077bac4c7
          blockGroup: a32026bba3a64e6b9caf6ec302d4ee1b
          sortingKey: "000261"
          type: code
